{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0075-sort-colors","title":"LeetCode 75 颜色分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0075-sort-colors","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-75-颜色分类\">LeetCode 75 颜色分类</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个包含红色、白色和蓝色共 <code>n</code> 个元素的数组 <code>nums</code>，<strong>原地</strong>对它们进行排序，使得相同颜色的元素相邻，并按照红色、白色、蓝色顺序排列。</p>\n<p>我们使用整数 <code>0</code>、<code>1</code> 和 <code>2</code> 分别表示红色、白色和蓝色。</p>\n<p>必须在不使用库内置的 sort 函数的情况下解决这个问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n == nums.length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 300</code></li>\n<li><code>nums[i]</code> 为 <code>0</code>、<code>1</code> 或 <code>2</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [2, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0]&#10;输出：[0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [2, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [2, 0, 1]&#10;输出：[0, 1, 2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [2, 0, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[0, 1, 2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>进阶：</strong> 你能想出一个仅使用常数空间的<strong>一趟</strong>扫描算法吗？</p>\n<p>本题的标准解法被称为<strong>荷兰国旗问题</strong>（Dutch National Flag Problem），由 Edsger Dijkstra 提出。它展示了如何在一次遍历中将数组三向分区——这一思想在快速排序的分区操作中有直接应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-两趟计数排序\">方法一：两趟计数排序</h3><p>最直接的方法：第一趟统计 0、1、2 各自的出现次数，第二趟根据计数结果覆写数组。虽然简单有效，但需要两趟遍历。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-荷兰国旗算法-一趟遍历\">方法二：荷兰国旗算法（一趟遍历）</h3><p>使用三个指针 <code>low</code>、<code>mid</code>、<code>high</code>，将数组分为四个区域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>[0, low)</td>\n<td>确定为 0</td>\n<td>红色区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[low, mid)</td>\n<td>确定为 1</td>\n<td>白色区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[mid, high]</td>\n<td>待处理</td>\n<td>未分类区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(high, n-1]</td>\n<td>确定为 2</td>\n<td>蓝色区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>初始状态：<code>low = 0</code>、<code>mid = 0</code>、<code>high = n-1</code>。</p>\n<p>遍历规则（<code>mid</code> 作为扫描指针）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>nums[mid]</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>swap(low, mid)，low++，mid++</td>\n<td>放到红色区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>mid++</td>\n<td>已经在白色区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>swap(mid, high)，high--</td>\n<td>放到蓝色区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>为什么遇到 2 时 mid 不移动？</strong> 因为交换过来的 <code>nums[high]</code> 的值还未知，需要在下一轮检查。而遇到 0 时 mid 可以安全移动，因为从 <code>low</code> 换来的要么是 1（如果 <code>low &lt; mid</code>），要么是 0（如果 <code>low === mid</code>），都不需要再处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三向分区与快速排序\">三向分区与快速排序</h3><p>荷兰国旗算法实质上是快速排序三向分区的特例。在快速排序中，选择一个 pivot，将数组分为「小于 pivot」「等于 pivot」「大于 pivot」三部分。当数组中有大量重复元素时，三向分区版本的快排比二向分区高效得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"荷兰国旗算法-推荐\">荷兰国旗算法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function sortColors(nums: number[]): void {&#10;  let low = 0;&#10;  let mid = 0;&#10;  let high = nums.length - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (mid &lt;= high) {&#10;    if (nums[mid] === 0) {&#10;      [nums[low], nums[mid]] = [nums[mid], nums[low]];&#10;      low++;&#10;      mid++;&#10;    } else if (nums[mid] === 1) {&#10;      mid++;&#10;    } else {&#10;      [nums[mid], nums[high]] = [nums[high], nums[mid]];&#10;      high--;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sortColors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> low </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [nums[low], nums[mid]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[mid], nums[low]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [nums[mid], nums[high]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[high], nums[mid]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"计数排序法\">计数排序法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function sortColors(nums: number[]): void {&#10;  const count = [0, 0, 0];&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    count[num]++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let idx = 0;&#10;  for (let color = 0; color &lt; 3; color++) {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; count[color]; i++) {&#10;      nums[idx++] = color;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sortColors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count[num]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count[color]; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nums[idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>荷兰国旗执行过程：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [2, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>low</th>\n<th>mid</th>\n<th>high</th>\n<th>nums[mid]</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>数组状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>swap(0,5), high--</td>\n<td>[0,0,2,1,1,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>swap(0,0), low++, mid++</td>\n<td>[0,0,2,1,1,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>swap(1,1), low++, mid++</td>\n<td>[0,0,2,1,1,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>swap(2,4), high--</td>\n<td>[0,0,1,1,2,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>mid++</td>\n<td>[0,0,1,1,2,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>mid++</td>\n<td>[0,0,1,1,2,2]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>mid&gt;high，结束</td>\n<td>[0,0,1,1,2,2]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>仅一趟遍历就完成了排序。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分区示意\">分区示意</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"排序完成后：&#10;[0, 0, | 1, 1, | 2, 2]&#10;  红色     白色     蓝色&#10; [0,low) [low,mid) [mid,n)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>排序完成后：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[0, 0, | 1, 1, | 2, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  红色     白色     蓝色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [0,low) [low,mid) [mid,n)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"两次-partition-法\">两次 partition 法</h3><p>也可以用两次 partition 实现：第一次把 0 放到前面，第二次把 1 放到 0 后面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function sortColors(nums: number[]): void {&#10;  let boundary = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    if (nums[i] === 0) {&#10;      [nums[i], nums[boundary]] = [nums[boundary], nums[i]];&#10;      boundary++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (let i = boundary; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    if (nums[i] === 1) {&#10;      [nums[i], nums[boundary]] = [nums[boundary], nums[i]];&#10;      boundary++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sortColors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boundary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [nums[i], nums[boundary]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[boundary], nums[i]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      boundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boundary; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [nums[i], nums[boundary]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [nums[boundary], nums[i]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      boundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>遍历次数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>荷兰国旗</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>一趟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数排序</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>两趟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两次 partition</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>两趟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 荷兰国旗算法中，<code>mid</code> 和 <code>high</code> 每步至少有一个在移动，总移动次数不超过 n，因此时间为 O(n)。每次操作（交换 + 指针移动）都是 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 所有方法都是原地操作，只使用了常数个变量，空间为 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>荷兰国旗的推广：</strong> 三向分区思想不仅用于排序三种颜色，更广泛地应用于：快速排序的优化（处理大量重复元素）、分区选择算法（QuickSelect）、以及任何需要将数组按照某个条件分为三部分的场景。Dijkstra 提出这个问题的初衷正是为了说明「简单的循环不变量如何保证程序的正确性」——low、mid、high 三个指针维护的四个区域就是循环不变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 75 颜色分类","id":"leetcode-75-颜色分类"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：两趟计数排序","id":"方法一-两趟计数排序"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：荷兰国旗算法（一趟遍历）","id":"方法二-荷兰国旗算法-一趟遍历"},{"level":3,"text":"三向分区与快速排序","id":"三向分区与快速排序"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"荷兰国旗算法（推荐）","id":"荷兰国旗算法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"计数排序法","id":"计数排序法"},{"level":3,"text":"分区示意","id":"分区示意"},{"level":3,"text":"两次 partition 法","id":"两次-partition-法"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 136 只出现一次的数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0136-single-number"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0011-container-with-most-water"}}